<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Bury</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>bury &lt;item&gt;          bury one item, from the ground or from your inventory
bury 2.&lt;item&gt;        bury the second item by that name
bury all.&lt;item&gt;      bury every item by that name, on the ground and in your inventory
bury all             bury everything lying on the ground here
</pre>
<p>Buries an item in the ground, out of sight. A buried item can't be seen or 
picked up; to get it back, <a cmd='#'>dig</a> for it: each dig turns up one buried 
thing in the room, and anyone can dig, not only the one who buried it.
</p><p>Buried things don't keep: an item that stays buried for an hour of real 
time rots away and is gone for good. Corpses keep their own clock: a buried corpse rots as any 
corpse does.
</p><p>You can only bury things you could pick up, out in a room (not inside a 
boat or the like), and not while you are fighting.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Dig</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Drop</a>
</pre>




</div>